    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} moves up to its Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks. During this movement, fire fills a 5-foot Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}. When the Emanation enters a creature's space, that creature takes [[/damage 2d6 average type=fire]] damage. A creature can take this damage only once per turn.</p>",
